{"seq":2,"slug":"invalid-gtin-validate-block","title":"无效/滥用 GTIN 校验拦截","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/gtin-product-identity-masterdata/identifier-governance/invalid-gtin-validate-block","wordCount":1955,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"无效-滥用-gtin-校验拦截\">无效/滥用 GTIN 校验拦截</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>渠道与平台对 GTIN 的校验不是一道，而是三道，且它们的能力边界逐级扩大。<strong>格式层</strong>只能挡住打字错误；<strong>号段层</strong>能挡住结构性滥用；<strong>语义层</strong>才真正挡住业务滥用。把三层混成一层的校验器，要么漏（只做格式层，渠道全拒绝），要么误杀（把号段层规则套到合法场景上）。</p>\n<p>三个执行点决定了校验的时机与代价：<strong>listing 提交</strong>（渠道侧校验，成本最低、最可逆）、<strong>数据池发布</strong>（影响所有下游订阅方，成本中等）、<strong>入库收货</strong>（货已印码，成本最高）。同一套规则在三处使用不同的处置策略。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  IN[输入 GTIN] --&gt; L1{格式层&lt;br/&gt;长度/数字/校验位}&#10;  L1 --&gt;|不通过| B1[BLOCK 阻断]&#10;  L1 --&gt;|通过| L2{号段层&lt;br/&gt;RCN/优惠券/保留段}&#10;  L2 --&gt;|命中| B2[BLOCK 阻断]&#10;  L2 --&gt;|通过| L3{语义层&lt;br/&gt;注册前缀/持有权/占用}&#10;  L3 --&gt;|冲突| W1[REVIEW 人工复核]&#10;  L3 --&gt;|可疑| W2[WARN 告警放行]&#10;  L3 --&gt;|无异常| OK[PASS]&#10;  B1 --&gt; LOG[(校验留痕)]&#10;  B2 --&gt; LOG&#10;  W1 --&gt; LOG&#10;  W2 --&gt; LOG&#10;  OK --&gt; LOG\">graph TD\n  IN[输入 GTIN] --&gt; L1{格式层&lt;br/&gt;长度/数字/校验位}\n  L1 --&gt;|不通过| B1[BLOCK 阻断]\n  L1 --&gt;|通过| L2{号段层&lt;br/&gt;RCN/优惠券/保留段}\n  L2 --&gt;|命中| B2[BLOCK 阻断]\n  L2 --&gt;|通过| L3{语义层&lt;br/&gt;注册前缀/持有权/占用}\n  L3 --&gt;|冲突| W1[REVIEW 人工复核]\n  L3 --&gt;|可疑| W2[WARN 告警放行]\n  L3 --&gt;|无异常| OK[PASS]\n  B1 --&gt; LOG[(校验留痕)]\n  B2 --&gt; LOG\n  W1 --&gt; LOG\n  W2 --&gt; LOG\n  OK --&gt; LOG</pre><h2 id=\"格式层-能挡住什么\">格式层：能挡住什么</h2><h3 id=\"长度与字符集\">长度与字符集</h3><p>合法的 GTIN 长度只有 8、12、13、14 四种。Google Merchant Center 的规范明确列出「接受的长度为 0、8、12、13 或 14 位数字」，空格与连字符会被接受但忽略（<a href=\"https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/6324461\">规范原文</a>）。长度校验的第一条实现细节是<strong>先归一化再判长</strong>：去掉空格与连字符、去掉前导 <code>&#39;</code>、统一全角数字。</p>\n<p>一个高频坑是<strong>电子表格把 GTIN 当数字处理</strong>：Excel 会把 <code>036000241457</code> 存成 <code>36000241457</code>（吃掉首位 0），科学计数法还会把长数字变成 <code>3.6E+11</code>。所以导入管道必须在解析层就把该列当<strong>字符串</strong>处理，并在导入后立即比对「入库值长度 = 源文件值长度」，长度不等即报错，而不是靠人工发现。</p>\n<h3 id=\"校验位\">校验位</h3><p>校验位算法见 <a href=\"../gtin-barcode-standard/gtin-upc-ean-isbn-structure\">GTIN/UPC/EAN/ISBN 结构与校验位</a>。这里只强调两点边界：<strong>校验位必须存在且正确</strong>，渠道会拒；以及<strong>校验位通过不等于可用</strong>——它挡不住任何语义问题。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 三层校验的完整判定：返回 verdict（BLOCK / REVIEW / WARN / PASS）与原因码&#10;CREATE TYPE gtin_verdict AS (verdict text, reason text);&#10;&#10;CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION validate_gtin(p_raw text, p_brand_gln char(13))&#10;RETURNS gtin_verdict LANGUAGE plpgsql AS $$&#10;DECLARE&#10;  v_norm char(14); v_len int; v_prefix varchar(12);&#10;BEGIN&#10;  -- 归一化：去分隔符、全角转半角、补零到 14 位&#10;  v_norm := regexp_replace(translate(p_raw,&#39;　０１２３４５６７８９&#39;,&#39; 0123456789&#39;),&#39;[^0-9]&#39;,&#39;&#39;,&#39;g&#39;);&#10;  v_len  := length(v_norm);&#10;  IF v_len NOT IN (8,12,13,14) THEN&#10;    RETURN (&#39;BLOCK&#39;,&#39;format.length&#39;)::gtin_verdict; END IF;&#10;  v_norm := lpad(v_norm, 14, &#39;0&#39;);&#10;&#10;  -- 格式层：校验位&#10;  IF gs1_check_digit(left(v_norm,13)) &lt;&gt; right(v_norm,1) THEN&#10;    RETURN (&#39;BLOCK&#39;,&#39;format.check_digit&#39;)::gtin_verdict; END IF;&#10;&#10;  -- 号段层：受限流通号 / 优惠券 / 保留段（按 13 位形式判前缀）&#10;  IF left(v_norm,2) = &#39;00&#39; AND (&#10;       substring(v_norm from 3 for 3) BETWEEN &#39;020&#39; AND &#39;029&#39;&#10;    OR substring(v_norm from 3 for 3) BETWEEN &#39;040&#39; AND &#39;049&#39;&#10;    OR substring(v_norm from 3 for 3) BETWEEN &#39;200&#39; AND &#39;299&#39;&#10;    OR substring(v_norm from 3 for 3) BETWEEN &#39;050&#39; AND &#39;059&#39;&#10;    OR substring(v_norm from 3 for 3) IN (&#39;980&#39;,&#39;981&#39;,&#39;982&#39;,&#39;983&#39;)&#10;    OR substring(v_norm from 3 for 3) BETWEEN &#39;990&#39; AND &#39;999&#39;) THEN&#10;    RETURN (&#39;BLOCK&#39;,&#39;range.restricted&#39;)::gtin_verdict; END IF;&#10;&#10;  -- 语义层：前缀是否已注册、持有人是否与声明一致&#10;  SELECT company_prefix INTO v_prefix FROM gtin_prefix_registry&#10;   WHERE v_norm LIKE company_prefix || &#39;%&#39; AND status = &#39;active&#39;&#10;   ORDER BY length(company_prefix) DESC LIMIT 1;&#10;&#10;  IF v_prefix IS NULL THEN&#10;    RETURN (&#39;REVIEW&#39;,&#39;semantic.prefix_unknown&#39;)::gtin_verdict; END IF;&#10;&#10;  IF NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM gtin_prefix_registry&#10;                  WHERE company_prefix = v_prefix AND owner_gln = p_brand_gln) THEN&#10;    RETURN (&#39;REVIEW&#39;,&#39;semantic.owner_mismatch&#39;)::gtin_verdict; END IF;&#10;&#10;  IF EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM product_identity_gtin&#10;              WHERE gtin14 = v_norm AND retired_at IS NOT NULL) THEN&#10;    RETURN (&#39;WARN&#39;,&#39;semantic.retired&#39;)::gtin_verdict; END IF;&#10;&#10;  RETURN (&#39;PASS&#39;,&#39;ok&#39;)::gtin_verdict;&#10;END $$;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 三层校验的完整判定：返回 verdict（BLOCK / REVIEW / WARN / PASS）与原因码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TYPE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> gtin_verdict</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (verdict </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE OR REPLACE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FUNCTION</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> validate_gtin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p_raw </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, p_brand_gln </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">char</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">13</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">RETURNS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gtin_verdict </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LANGUAGE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plpgsql </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $$</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DECLARE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  v_norm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">char</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); v_len </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; v_prefix </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">varchar</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  -- 归一化：去分隔符、全角转半角、补零到 14 位</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  v_norm :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> regexp_replace(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">translate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(p_raw,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'　０１２３４５６７８９'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">' 0123456789'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'[^0-9]'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">''</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'g'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  v_len  :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v_norm);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  IF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v_len </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">13</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    RETURN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'BLOCK'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'format.length'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)::gtin_verdict; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  v_norm :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lpad(v_norm, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  -- 格式层：校验位</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  IF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gs1_check_digit(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">left</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v_norm,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">13</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> right</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v_norm,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    RETURN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'BLOCK'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'format.check_digit'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)::gtin_verdict; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  -- 号段层：受限流通号 / 优惠券 / 保留段（按 13 位形式判前缀）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  IF</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> left</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v_norm,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '00'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       substring</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v_norm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> for</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '020'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '029'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    OR</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> substring</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v_norm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> for</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '040'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '049'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    OR</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> substring</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v_norm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> for</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '200'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '299'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    OR</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> substring</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v_norm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> for</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '050'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '059'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    OR</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> substring</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v_norm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> for</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'980'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'981'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'982'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'983'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    OR</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> substring</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(v_norm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"colo